From: tom <tompt@seznam.cz>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:15:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] iio: light: add raw CT709 color channels on J120

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/iio/light/Kconfig     |   7 ++
 drivers/iio/light/Makefile    |   1 +
 drivers/iio/light/ams-ct709.c | 189 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/iio/light/ams-ct709.h | 212 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 409 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/iio/light/ams-ct709.c
